intro = Spirit of the Mountain: "Ai entrusted the peak with what she could no longer bear: her voice, her sorrow, her fury. Climb up to her."
leap.intro = Walk through the lightning orbs: each orb gives a Charged Leap stack (3 at most, 20 s). The broken stairs take two.
leap.gain = Charged Leap: {stacks} stack(s).
stairs.elementals = Air elementals guard the stairs: their orbs will carry you higher.
stairs.mended = The plinth awakens: the stairs reform behind you.
stairs.waiting = The plinth waits until the three air elementals are defeated.
checkpoint = Checkpoint reached.
column.open = A wind column rises: step into it.
voice.enter = The Voice of the Mountain rumbles over the plateau.
voice.storm = The Voice withdraws into a tornado: disperse the four storm clouds with a charged leap!
voice.cloud = A storm cloud disperses ({count}/{total}).
voice.back = The tornado dies down: the Voice is vulnerable again.
voice.reset = The Voice falls silent... for now.
voice.victory = The Voice of the Mountain falls silent. A wind column leads to the waterfall ledge.
water.intro = The waterfall ledge: when the water roars, leave the red strips. Three water elementals are scared: crouch near them to calm them.
water.surge = The waterfall surges!
water.calming = Stay crouched near the elemental...
water.calmed = The water elemental calms down and leaves ({count}/{total}).
water.sprites = Enraged water sprites burst out!
water.done = All three elementals are calm: the barrier opens. Further on, the floating rocks.
sorrow.enter = The Sorrow of the Mountain is trapped under fallen boulders: break them. The dark orb tethers the closest player: step into the beam to take the tether.
sorrow.tether = The dark orb tethers you: the Tidal Bargain rises!
sorrow.taken = {name} takes the tether.
tide.drowned = The tide drowns {name}!
sorrow.boulder = A fallen boulder breaks ({count}/{total}).
sorrow.reset = The boulders fall back onto the Sorrow.
sorrow.victory = The Sorrow of the Mountain is free: the lava path opens.
lava.wall = Lava elementals guard this wall: bring them down.
lava.split = The elemental explodes and splits!
lava.open = The rock wall collapses.
fury.enter = The Fury of the Mountain bursts from the crater!
fury.meteors = The Fury calls meteors: leave the circles, then hide behind a meteor!
fury.extreme = Extreme strike! Hide behind a meteor!
fury.tracking = Two meteors follow {a} and {b}: cross them so they shatter each other!
fury.shattered = The two meteors shatter each other.
fury.defiance = The Fury flares up: break its defiance!
fury.inferno = The defiance holds: the Fury unleashes an inferno!
fury.reset = The Fury returns to the crater.
fury.victory = The Fury of the Mountain dies out: the climb to the summit opens.
ai.enter = Ai, Keeper of the Peak: "You crossed my emotions. Let's see if you can bear all of me."
ai.lines = Ai dashes to the edge of the arena: orb waves sweep the floor. Break her defiance!
ai.lines.broken = Ai's defiance breaks: she staggers!
ai.bombs = Storm bombs: a circle follows you. Spread out!
ai.sweep = Ai sweeps the arena!
ai.storm = Storm front: Ai shields herself; disperse the clouds with a charged leap!
ai.fire = Ai bursts into flame: fire takes over.
ai.meteors = Ai calls meteors!
ai.rain = Meteor rain: Ai shields herself, hold on!
ai.water = Ai becomes the tide: water takes over.
ai.shared = Shared tide on {name}: join them to share the damage!
ai.dark = Ai darkens: her last emotion, fear, takes over!
ai.fears = Fears follow you: kill them before they burst!
ai.fear.burst = A fear bursts!
ai.vulnerable = Ai is vulnerable again.
ai.reset = Ai withdraws into the calm of the peak.
ai.victory = Ai calms down: "Thank you." The treasure of Sunqua Peak is yours.
title.victory = Sunqua Peak complete
